    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d282">

                <pb facs="0502" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 851.857Su8/16</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Sharp</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-28T22:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 28, 1916, 10 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 29, 8.15 a.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1330. Department’s 1438, March 27, repeated from London. Of ten American
                    survivors making affidavit not one saw any signs of guns on <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Sussex</hi>. Foreign Office officially informs me that
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Sussex</hi> was not armed and that Channel passenger
                    steamers are not armed and have not been. Major Logan and
                    Lieutenant Smith, after careful examination of <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Sussex</hi> at Boulogne, report they could see no
                    indications of any gun mountings.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sharp</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
